        <mxCell id="c296" value="&lt;i&gt;Revenue is in thousands of dollars so that twelve columns fit; the PivotTable shows whole dollars. Rows 1 to 15, which hold the first PivotTable, and column N, the Grand Total of the two years, are not shown. Blank cells are combinations with no revenue: only Design Services buys Services. Outlined: the Columns area, where FiscalYear sits above ItemGroup, and the Change from 2025 row of Wholesale, blank under 2025 and filled under 2026.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="660" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
